    "first_frame is an estimate: the p95 pass time plus 8 decoded frames, after (H1 + R) = 13 frames of audio, against the browser's 0.4 s start buffer, for TTS producing audio at the given real-time factor. Real arrival schedules come from recorded live calls.",
    "upstream's wav2vec2 wrapper sets config.output_attentions, which transformers 4.57 refuses under SDPA; the spike loads it with attn_implementation='eager'."
